# LF in every checkout, Windows included (git for Windows defaults core.autocrlf=true, and so does
# actions/checkout on windows-latest). Tests compare generated files byte for byte with committed
# ones, and sh scripts with CRLF do not run. cmd.exe needs CRLF in batch files.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.icns binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.wav binary
*.pdf binary

packages/protocol/CHANGES.md merge=union
